    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Do you cover relocations within London itself, not just moving away from it?</summary><p>Yes. We support clients moving within London, out of London to another part of the UK, or into London &mdash; the service works the same way regardless of direction.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you help navigate leasehold sale complications?</summary><p>Yes. Solicitor coordination is included from Gold Prestige upwards, covering the extra checks a leasehold sale typically involves.</p></details>
